# TrueCraft+ Ultimate - full guide
tellraw @s {"text":"======= TrueCraft+ ULTIMATE - Real Survival =======","color":"dark_green"}
tellraw @s {"text":"TEMPERATURE - body 0-100. 0-10 hypothermia (damage!), 10-30 cold, 30-70 comfort, 70-90 hot, 90-100 heat stroke (damage!). Deserts & the Nether cook you, snow/mountains/night/rain freeze you. Shelter and deep bases stabilize temperature.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"CLOTHING - leather warms, iron conducts (bad in extremes), chain breathes, gold absorbs sun. CRAFT: Fur Hood/Coat/Boots (rabbit hide) = best winter gear. Desert Headwrap/Robes/Sandals (white wool) = best heat gear. Backpack lightens your load.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"STAMINA - sprinting, jumping, swimming and fighting drain it. At 0 you are exhausted (heavy slowness). Recover by resting (sneak), sitting by a campfire, or staying comfortable. Watch the Sta value on the HUD.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"THIRST - stand IN water + sneak to drink (risky). Water bottles: near a campfire they count as BOILED (+50, safe). Canteen: craft filter+leather, holds +80 purified water and refills! Eat snow for a sip.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"FOOD - raw meat can poison you. Craft Survivor's Stew (bowl+cooked beef+mushroom+carrot) for food AND hydration. Bandages (paper+string) heal injuries: eat one after bad falls.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"WEATHER - rain soaks and chills you, thunderstorms are dangerous outside, and heat waves scorch the desert. Watch the red warnings.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"CAMPING - campfire = warmth+drying. + bed = Safe Camp (regeneration). + chest, furnace & crafting table nearby = Permanent Base (best recovery). Craft a Sleeping Bag (wool+leather) for a portable bed.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"BASES - enclosed spaces stabilize temperature. Stone floors insulate better than wood. Deep underground (y<=30) is climate-stable year-round.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"INJURIES - big falls injure you (slowness). Rest, eat well, or apply a bandage.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"EXPLORATION - new biomes give points; milestones on days 1/5/10/30/100. /function truecraft:ruin spawns an abandoned camp with a loot chest.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"LIGHT & TRADES - holding a torch/soul torch/lantern emits real light. Wandering traders sell premium gear.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"CONFIG - /function truecraft:config  |  Test kit: /function truecraft:items  |  Uninstall: /function truecraft:uninstall","color":"gray"}
